Misho, 10 Oct ~06:20 UTC, in the code session's chat: „BD კი, BE კი".

- WAVE_ORDER_GATE_ON = true. While a wave has room, the room goes to the
  next people in the server's order. Anyone else is refused with the
  approved line (§123). The person the owner named still goes at any time
  (D625). Two tests now walk the on path: a person out of order is
  refused with the first three named, and an owner-named person goes.
- SEE_HELPER_ON = true. A helper row of the list Excel says
  „იხ. დამხმარე" in its „nobody / no route" cells (§124).

Each undo is the one switch back to false.

DONE WHEN: an ask out of order inside a wave is refused with the names of
the next people, and the owner-named person goes; the 4160 file's helper
rows read „იხ. დამხმარე".

